  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with <br>boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt. <br>• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.<br>• Cook potato in the boiling water over high heat, <br>until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. <br>• Drain cooked potato, then return to the pan. <br>Add the butter, milk and Parmesan cheese. <br>• Mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.</p> <p><br>TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the <br>potato unpeeled! <br>Little cooks: Get those muscles working and help <br>mash the potatoes!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ec35963fcd98f40af0/step-e23cb200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, slice carrot into thin sticks.</p> <p>• Trim green beans. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ec35963fcd98f40af0/step-d4a1ac10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</p> <p>• Cook carrot and green beans, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.</p> <p>• Season with salt and pepper. Transfer to a bowl. Cover to keep warm.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ec35963fcd98f40af0/step-3c617920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.</p> <p>• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.</p> <p>• Add Aussie spice blend and cook, turning to coat until fragrant, 1 minute.</p> <p>• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ec35963fcd98f40af0/step-0c9daf30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to medium heat.</p> <p>• Add light cooking cream (see ingredients) and basil pesto. Stir to combine, then simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.</p> <p>• Season to taste, then remove pan from heat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ec35963fcd98f40af0/step-a9021240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide Aussie crumbed chick&#39;n, Parmesan mash and veggies between plates.</p> <p>• Spoon creamy pesto sauce over chicken and mash to serve. Enjoy!</p> <p>Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by spooning over the creamy pesto sauce!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ec35963fcd98f40af0/step-3944e450.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
